{"id": "Dfd1En6xXny", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Far from home this Diwali? Her diya still finds you. 🪔\n\nSomewhere tonight, a grandmother lights a diya by the tulsi, the way she has every Diwali. And somewhere far away, in a city flat, a row of diyas waits on a balcony.\n\nLight travels. So does love. Light yours tonight, and call the one who taught you how. 💛\n\nHappy Diwali from Rishi Katha 🙏\nStories from our Puranas for children, beautifully illustrated: the Navadurga Set is out now · link in bio (rishikatha.com)\n\nSend this to someone who's away from home this Diwali, and save it for next year. 🪔\n\n#HappyDiwali #Diwali2026 #Diwali #Deepavali #DiwaliVibes #Diya #FarFromHome #DiwaliAwayFromHome #Tulsi #IndianFestival #HinduFestival #Dadi #Nani #RishiKatha #FestivalOfLights", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1794109819, "like_count": 997, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1387051930170284a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 50.243, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMeFNTZXnhE9F0jrwsBEm-fEne0YmSXV1xxZfbdUg_vOSfIChAX49wjx7e3nzINGKDudQ6IuzCVLN6B4FVTMHN0ImTbFoiE8j-y-rs.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adrr46flApuYMM0TKy1ZzI7B54f04xhNjLf7bma5Pk71fbKOTwp5zcvoYEDtQo37LS93farbzYi3ZbmYQCoXmJkj&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=M9Exao1-iWIQ7kNvwH9kT_e&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hO0lHqrfMOJzMFTxTKiP-Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQNZggFOq6r39tIA_7WZMBcBmiqQYsrpR0ZlCj06DC_Hg&oe=6AF3FCD2", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 50.243, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36